# MaCSad read-only development gateway

Import GatewayHttp from "./gateway_http.lg".
Import GatewayRouting from "./gateway_routing.lg".

The production entry composes the imported LOGOS request handler and owns the
development listener. No mutation transport is present in this baseline.
The complete reachable closure is also imported here as a pinned-compiler
scope-attribution compatibility lock; logical dependencies remain module-local.

## Main
Serve on port 18081 with handle.
